== Walkthrough ==

'''Shazda Asad is located at 398, -281 in Kerra Island. Indifferent faction is sufficient to receive the reward for this quest. You may use charm, or have an enchanter charm Shazda for you (however, the faction hit will be omitted in that case).'''

You say, 'Hail, Shazda Asad'

: Shazda Asad says 'Rrrr..I am Asad, Shazda of the Kerran [Sejah]. It is my duty to ensure the safety of what lands have not been taken from us by the Erudites, and to train my soldiers in the fighting styles of our heritage.'

You say, 'What Sejah?'

: Shazda Asad says 'The soldiers of our sejah are all trained from the time they are weaned from their matriarchs. If you wish to be honored by the sejah you must prove to us your loyalty and devotion to the defense of our lands. In Toxxulia Forest there are Erudite emissaries who constantly attempt to encroach upon our territory. Bring me the head of one such emissary.'

Asad, the Shazda of the Kerran Sejah has given you a direct order. You are to travel to Toxxulia Forest and hunt down an Erudin Emissay. Do not return to the Shazda until you have retrieved the emissary's head. Body not required

=== Quest Stage 1: ===
* Step - Claim the head of the Erudin Emissary in Toxxulia Forest
* Task - Claim the head of an Erudin Emissay in Toxxulia <br> 

'''[[an Erudin Emissary]] can be found wandering Toxxulia Forest. Kill them.'''

 You have slain an Erudin Emissary!
 --You have looted an Emissary Head from an Erudin Emissary's corpse.--

